cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to PMDS, please cite it as below."
title: "PMDS: Phase Modulation Data Service"
abstract: >-
  RDS-style station data (station code, name, RadioText, program type and an alert flag)
  carried as slow phase modulation of a mono AM broadcast carrier: 93.75 bit/s at 8.6
  degrees peak deviation, with the envelope untouched. A draft specification, a reference
  encoder and decoder in Python, the decoder in C for microcontrollers, and GNU Radio tools
  for the bench.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Foley
    given-names: Michael
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24481660
repository-code: "https://github.com/axle2152/pmds"
